PRO_1616,Smt Hombalamma vs Chief Executive Officer,"1. Pursuant thereto, the petitioners preferred an appeal in Appeal No.1/2025 before respondent No.1 - the Appellate Authority. However, according to the petitioners, respondent No.1, without properly appreciating the factual and legal contentions raised by them and without adverting to the jurisdictional issue raised by the petitioners, dismissed the appeal by order dated 30.07.",PROPERTY,,,,,,,,
