PRO_1740,Smt Hombalamma vs Chief Executive Officer,"1. Sri. K.N. Nithish submits that both the Petitioners are absolute owners in possession and enjoyment of their respective properties situated at Kodagahalli Village, BasaraluHobli, Mandya Taluk and District. Petitioner No.1 is the absolute owner of a house property in respect of which an E-Khatha bearing No.152100404801220007 has been issued by the competent authority. Petitioner No.2 claims Smt. Hombalamma vs The Chief Executive Officer And The ... on 13 March, 2026 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/54903552/ 41 to be the absolute owner of property bearing Site No.6/",PROPERTY,,,,,,,,
PRO_1741,Smt Hombalamma vs Chief Executive Officer,"6. Both properties are ancestral in nature and the Petitioners' family has been in - 56 - NC: 2026:KHC:15472 WP No. 26364 of 2025 HC-KAR continuous, open and peaceful possession and enjoyment thereof for more than eighty years. 18.",PROPERTY,,,,,,,,
